  "description": "Thirty-year-old Gang Nak-Kyeong is a boiler repairman by day and a dog-loving shelter volunteer in his free time. He’s more than happy to enjoy his simple, ordinary life until twenty-four-year old Nam Ji-Ha comes crashing into his life, calling him out for late night repairs and animal advice. Is Nak-Kyeong ready to let another stray into his heart, or will Ji-Ha have to keep searching for his forever home…?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n *Note: Includes 13 extra chapters.*",
